ica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9209234011/original/Z96nkEKOyAXrjqpsT-b0tthSl8coRAEAFw.png?1712581326\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9209234011\"></p><p style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Once approved, click 'Pension Assessment' tab to run the Pension if the employees are eligible.</span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9209234045/original/4-ZbJ1SIsHLv5QAaqCqhw5PA_Jw7CdXn7Q.png?1712581351\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9209234045\"></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Next, click the 'Payroll' tab and click Run Payroll.</span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">